{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_handoff75", "label": "HANDOFF-75 (chat 122 to chat 123)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The R2 chat-to-chat handoff: the whole transferable state of a section read, written so the successor chat re-measures everything rather than trusting a carried number."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_chat95_bar", "label": "Chat-95 bar: a finding is not a question", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A deviation in the mathematics or the prose is recorded and flagged for repair, never put to M; Prints & Proofs is read before any question is asked. Keeps the author out of the audit loop."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_chat81_cadence", "label": "Chat-81 cadence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Read the unit, census its claims in two kinds (computable and prose), run exactly two instrument batches, never split a section read. Bounds a chat's work to something that can close."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_cap_variation_table", "label": "Cap-variation table exact in twenty-eight figures", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A negative witness: recorded so a defect class is not made to look worse than the book is."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_surplus_convention", "label": "Surplus = |J| - log2(cells)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Derived from L2149's '976 of the 131,072 available seventeen-bit words'; a table's convention is derived from the book before the table is scored, never guessed from a neighbouring column."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_factor_q_lambda9_fault", "label": "r2lib.factor_q is a Lambda-9 function (chat 122 fault 1)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its tgt() reads tuple index 8, which an 8-tuple has not; for Lambda-8 the halves are source 0,1,2,7, transfer 3, target 4,5,6."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_thousands_separator_sweep", "label": "A numeral sweep must match the printed thousands separator", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chat 122's fault 3: a digit-bounded sweep on the unseparated form scored 8,853 / 19,109 / 35,789 at zero sites including their own table line. Sweep both N and f'{N:,}'."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_phihat_pairs_not_chi_factors", "label": "phi-hat pairs are not chi's factors", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chat 122's fault 2 scored the book's seven factors against sixteen binding phi-hat pairs; chi's factors are the construction's own inter-coordinate bounds, read off tower-2.py L8()."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_body_range_vs_section_span", "label": "body_range and section_span differ wherever a section has subsections", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolve every pointer under both resolvers, always, and say so when they coincide."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_meet_characterisation", "label": "Join-irreducibles counted by meet-characterisation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The naive lower-cover scan is O(n^3) and hangs the instrument at 35,789 cells; state a budget rather than a negative."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_pp_offset_94", "label": "One global Prints & Proofs offset of -94", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Anchored per witness on its own text, because chat 120 measured -88 and -94 inside a single 99-line unit."}, {"id": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_l9057_chapter_claims", "label": "L9057's two chapter claims", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One sentence making two chapter claims, one true of Chapter 29 rather than Chapter 28 and one true of no chapter at all."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_handoff75", "target": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_chat95_bar", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/HANDOFF-75__7e55057b.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_handoff75", "target": "recovered_handoff_75__7e55057b_chat81_cadence", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovere